WEBVTT

00:51:29.288 --> 00:51:33.204
But if you were asked in a reflective
moment where you were sort of fully alert

00:51:33.204 --> 00:51:35.913
and thoughtful, do you want
to spend as much time

00:51:35.913 --> 00:51:39.079
as you do scrolling through Instagram?
Does it make you happier or not?

00:51:39.704 --> 00:51:43.621
You would actually be able to give
like the right long term answer?

00:51:43.663 --> 00:51:46.579
It's sort of the spirit is willing, but
the flesh is weak kind of moment.

00:51:47.079 --> 00:51:54.038
And one thing that I am hopeful is that
humans do know what we want and what.

00:51:54.954 --> 00:51:57.788
On the whole, and presented
with research or sort of

00:51:57.788 --> 00:52:00.538
an objective view about what makes us
happy and doesn't we're pretty,